From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CoreXGT <aulia.ikbal09@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:41:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] init: enable adbd at boot (cm-13.0)

cm-13.0 port of the cm-14.1 patch of the same name.

On cm-14.1 the adbd service lives in rootdir/init.usb.rc; on cm-13.0 it
lives in rootdir/init.rc with the identical stanza. Keep the "disabled"
line commented out so adbd comes up on boot instead of waiting for a
USB property trigger (BUGFIXES.md #7).

Change-Id: I0000000000000000000000000000000000000004
---
 rootdir/init.rc | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/rootdir/init.rc b/rootdir/init.rc
--- a/rootdir/init.rc
+++ b/rootdir/init.rc
@@ -609,5 +609,5 @@
 service adbd /sbin/adbd --root_seclabel=u:r:su:s0
     class core
     socket adbd stream 660 system system
-    disabled
+    #disabled
     seclabel u:r:adbd:s0
 
--
2.53.0
